      "options": {
       "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/loose.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n<title></title>\r\n<style type=\"text/css\">body {\r\n            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            padding: 0;\r\n            background-color: #f4f4f4;\r\n            color: #333;\r\n            line-height: 1.6;\r\n        }\r\n        .container {\r\n            width: 80%;\r\n            margin: auto;\r\n            overflow: hidden;\r\n            padding: 2em;\r\n            background-color: #fff;\r\n            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\r\n        }\r\n        h1, h2, h3 {\r\n            color: #b70000;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            font-family: 'Garamond', serif;\r\n        }\r\n        p {\r\n            font-size: 1.1em;\r\n            margin-bottom: 1em;\r\n        }\r\n        .highlight {\r\n            color: #b70000;\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n        }\r\n        .story-section {\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n            justify-content: space-between;\r\n            margin: 2em 0;\r\n            padding: 1em;\r\n            background-color: #f9f9f9;\r\n            border-radius: 5px;\r\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\r\n        }\r\n        .story-section:nth-child(even) {\r\n            background-color: #fff;\r\n        }\r\n        .story-text {\r\n            flex: 1;\r\n            padding: 1em;\r\n        }\r\n        .story-image {\r\n            flex: 1;\r\n            padding: 1em;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n            justify-content: center;\r\n        }\r\n        .story-image img {\r\n            max-width: 100%;\r\n            border-radius: 5px;\r\n            border: 2px solid #b70000;\r\n        }\r\n        .cta {\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            margin: 2em 0;\r\n        }\r\n        .cta a {\r\n            background-color: #b70000;\r\n            color: #fff;\r\n            padding: 1em 2em;\r\n            text-decoration: none;\r\n            border-radius: 5px;\r\n            font-size: 1.2em;\r\n        }\r\n        .cta a:hover {\r\n            background-color: #a10000;\r\n        }\r\n        .testimonial {\r\n            background-color: #f9f9f9;\r\n            padding: 1em;\r\n            border-left: 4px solid #b70000;\r\n            margin: 2em 0;\r\n            font-style: italic;\r\n        }\r\n        .footer {\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            margin: 2em 0;\r\n        }\r\n        .footer a {\r\n            color: #b70000;\r\n            text-decoration: none;\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n        }\r\n        .footer a:hover {\r\n            text-decoration: underline;\r\n        }\r\n</style>\r\n</head><body><div class=\"container\">\r\n<h1>YOUR NEIGHBOR JUST SOLD HER HOME FOR $117,000 MORE THAN SHE BOUGHT IT FOR!</h1>\r\n\r\n<h2><em><span style=\"color:#000000;\">CURIOUS HOW SHE DID IT?&nbsp;</span></em><br>\r\nHERE'S THE STORY...</h2>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"story-section\">\r\n<div class=\"story-image\"><img alt=\"Christine on the phone\" src=\"https://idx-acnt-ihouseprd.b-cdn.net/AR1140900/file_manager/Contact%20Christine%20Gwinnup%2C%20The%20Little%20Lady%20Sells%20Homes.png\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"story-text\">\r\n<p class=\"highlight\">YOUR NEIGHBOR CALLED ME...</p>\r\n\r\n<p>She was ready to sell because she needed to move closer to her mom.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"story-section\">\r\n<div class=\"story-text\">\r\n<p class=\"highlight\">I GOT TO WORK&hellip;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I arranged for professional photos, scheduled open houses sent out postcards and created a&nbsp;video.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"story-image\"><img alt=\"House Photo 1\" src=\"https://idx-acnt-ihouseprd.b-cdn.net/AR1140900/file_manager/Approved%20Images/The%20Little%20Lady%20sells%20homes%20111%202nd%20st.jpg\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"story-section\">\r\n<div class=\"story-image\"><img alt=\"House Photo 2\" src=\"https://idx-acnt-ihouseprd.b-cdn.net/AR1140900/file_manager/Approved%20Images/ev-5LrGwKcf55OEgH5n-nQVB9W4z_zh4LA.jpg\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"story-text\">\r\n<p class=\"highlight\">A BUZZWORTHY LAUNCH...</p>\r\n\r\n<p>My marketing efforts generated significant interest, leading to 17 showings in just two weeks.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"story-section\">\r\n<div class=\"story-text\">\r\n<p class=\"highlight\">THE OFFER&hellip;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Within two weeks, we received a full-priced offer, which was almost $10,000 more than Zillow's Zestimate.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"story-image\"><img alt=\"Offer Document\" src=\"https://idx-acnt-ihouseprd.b-cdn.net/AR1140900/file_manager/355,000.png\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"story-section\">\r\n<div class=\"story-image\"><img alt=\"Marketing\" src=\"https://idx-acnt-ihouseprd.b-cdn.net/AR1140900/file_manager/Screenshot%202024-06-06%20at%202.41.06%E2%80%AFAM.png\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"story-text\">\r\n<p class=\"highlight\">MASTERFUL MARKETING...</p>\r\n\r\n<p>My aggressive social media and online marketing created urgency and allowed my Seller to hold firm on the price and terms.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"story-section\">\r\n<div class=\"story-text\">\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">111 2nd St, Ault</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>My marketing strategy and implementation resulted in these sweet results:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>17 Showings in Just Two Weeks</li>\r\n\t<li>$355,000 Under Contract Price</li>\r\n\t<li>Approximately $301.61 Per Square Foot</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"story-image\"><img alt=\"Christine and Client with 'I love my realtor' sign\" src=\"https://idx-acnt-ihouseprd.b-cdn.net/AR1140900/file_manager/IMG_5896.jpeg\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"testimonial\">\r\n<p>\"Christine did an excellent job selling my home! She made everything easy and explained things every step of the way. I would highly recommend her and her team!\" &ndash; Kerry</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"cta\">\r\n<h2>Do you have a similar goal?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Let's chat! I love working with Sellers and look forward to setting you up for success and top dollar!</p>\r\n<a href=\"mailto:christine@example.com\">Call Christine 303-709-4262</a>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\nGet a no-obligation home valuation and order your free \"Preparing to List\" book below!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"footer\">\r\n<h2>WATCH THE MAGIC HAPPEN</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/MDfyzESb1Yk?si=1lCFdS33qyCUj1cb\">Watch Christine's&nbsp;videos HERE</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></body></html>\n"
      }
